
Daily Update Task Process PM
============================

The repository receives daily tasks, sends personalised Lark form links, stores
standup responses and tracks submission status.

Standup reminders
-----------------

`.github/workflows/send-standup-reminders.yml` checks the latest task and
response files at these Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh times:

- 17:59 — `Đừng quên fill task hôm nay nhé!`
- 18:09 — `Suýt quên! Fill task thôi`
- 18:19 — `Mãi làm quá đúng ko? Đừng quên fill task nhé`

At every run, only members who have tasks for the current day and have not yet
submitted receive a Lark card. If everyone has submitted, nothing is sent. A
stale `daily-tasks.json` payload is ignored, so old tasks cannot trigger a new
day's reminder.

The workflow uses the existing `LARK_APP_ID` and `LARK_APP_SECRET` repository
secrets. It can also be run manually in dry-run mode from GitHub Actions to
preview the recipients without sending messages.

Local dry-run example:

```bash
python scripts/send-reminders.py --reminder-index 1 --dry-run
```
